    \angle O_1P'A&=\angle O_1P'P-\angle AP'P&=\angle O_1O_2P-\angle APP'&=2\angle PXO_1-90^\circ+\angle PAX
    &=2\angle PXO_1-90^\circ+\frac{\angle{XO_2P}}{2}&=2\angle PXO_1-90^\circ+\frac{180^\circ-\angle{O_1O_2P}}{2}&=2\angle PXO_1-90^\circ+90^\circ-\angle PXO_1&=\alpha.
